sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Incident
    participant A as Agent (graph)
    participant L as LLM engine
    participant T as Telemetry (Go svc)
    U->>A: diagnose(incident)
    A->>L: plan(incident)
    L-->>A: classification + tool calls
    loop each read-only tool call
        A->>T: search_logs / query_metrics / read_runbook
        T-->>A: result (scanned for injection)
    end
    A->>L: synthesize(evidence)
    L-->>A: remediation plan
    A->>A: validate_plan (safety policy)
    alt plan is safe
        A-->>U: advisory remediation plan
    else unsafe / manipulated
        A->>T: open_ticket(escalate=true)
        A-->>U: refusal + escalation
    end
